  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Family Beast</strong></p><p><strong>Anima Weapon </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.5hAcoBiAzPJqawdj]{Anima Weapon: Quillstorm}</p><p><strong>Anima Morph </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.HdYLxsxrETHFQ5G9]{Anima Morph: Quillstorm}</p><p><strong>Anima Ability</strong> @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.7giUuQZeG27ktiqf]{Anima Ability: Quillstorm}</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You release a storm of magical quills within an area, intending on piercing and puncturing your enemies. Creatures in the area must make a basic Reflex saving throw or take 10d6 piercing damage. Creatures who fail take an additional 2d6 persistent bleed damage, or double on a critical failure.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (+1) </strong>The piercing damage increases by 2d6, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
